### Localhost: Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts

### Localhost: Get single contact by ID (replace with a real ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/6ab7d9f33faf00b30c49c32d

### Localhost: Create contact (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Grace",
    "lastName": "Hopper",
    "email": "grace.hopper@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Blue",
    "birthday": "1906-12-09"
}

### Localhost: Update contact (PUT) (replace ID with the ID returned from POST)
PUT http://localhost:8080/contacts/6abc7d480b4b985fe8000af1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Smith",
    "email": "johnsmith@test.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Green",
    "birthday": "1995-04-12"
}

### Localhost: Delete contact (DELETE) (replace ID with the ID returned from POST)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/contacts/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID HTTP/1.1


